        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "Religion was essential to the ancient Egyptians."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "They had over 2,000 different gods."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "Some of the gods looked magical and strange."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "The most famous is Ra."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "He was the god of the sun and life."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "He had a man’s body, but a hawk’s head."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "One of the oldest is the powerful goddess Sekhmet."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "She had the head of a lioness."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "Osiris was the god of death."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "His skin was green, the color of rebirth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "We learned about these gods from colorful paintings on ancient Egyptian walls."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
